      "data":{"content":{"kind":"markdown","value":"## Section expansion\n\nResolve the article shell and section manifest. Derive one labeled handle per section. Dragging a section handle instantiates a wikipedia-section node with article and section identity. The new Section resolves its body lazily and repeats the grammar for subsections.\n\nThe template deliberately does not materialize the whole article graph up front."},"interfaceContract":{"version":1,"receivesViewContent":true}}
